In summary, we proposed to amend § 425.612(a)(1)(i)(A) to require that an ACO applying to use the SNF 3-Day Rule Waiver must submit an attestation that it has established plan narratives (communication plan, care management plan, and beneficiary evaluation and admission plan) and will make them available to CMS upon request. We proposed minor revisions to the narrative language by replacing “the communication plan” with “a communication plan” in § 425.612(a)(1)(i)(A)(
1
